    <string name="screenshots_select_hint">Click a mark to select it: drag it to move (edges snap to other marks and the center), drag a square to resize or remove it with the cross. The mouse wheel over it changes thickness, Shift+wheel changes size, and the settings above apply to it. Ctrl+C, Ctrl+V and Ctrl+D copy, paste and duplicate. Space with the left button pans the canvas, the right button opens a menu.</string>
    <string name="screenshots_crop_confirm">Crop (Enter)</string>
    <string name="screenshots_crop_cancel">Cancel the crop (Esc)</string>
